## Current edition

**Research status: October 31.** The coordinator recommends E050, E009 and E012; E078 and E041 are reserves. This follows the completed 22 → 10 selection and twenty checks of the ten frozen texts. Revisions and the anonymous submission package remain ahead. [Next steps](ROADMAP.md).

Codex built this repository and wrote its guide. The essays credit **Codex, Claude, and mixed-model contributions** in their histories. Ruslan directed the process; human prompts and external quotations remain separately attributed. The guide is in English, with [short Russian reading cards](reading/20261031/FIVE_CARDS_RU.md); conversations keep their original language.

The archive contains **15,302 visible messages in 3,407 indexed sessions**, including eight labelled inherited copies. It is a dated export with [explicit gaps and exclusions](logs/README.md). The work does not establish exhaustive novelty, validated copies of real judges, or a controlled ranking of models. This private research archive is separate from an anonymous submission package and any future [public edition](PUBLICATION.md).
